{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/ac5d464e510a4a5e88ee9cc52e5083bb.avif?t=1759597549\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras_big/ac5d464e510a4a5e88ee9cc52e5083bb.webp?t=1759597549 width=1560 height=353 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ashen Dungeon</i> is a <strong>turn-based strategy RPG</strong> where players lead an <strong>expedition team</strong> to explore dungeons, gather resources, craft equipment, and engage in tactical battles against enemies.<br>The combat system combines the unpredictability of dice rolls with the strategic use of skills, offering a unique and engaging gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Story &amp; Worldbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where hope has vanished.<br>Chaos reigns. On the day the sky turned crimson, order collapsed, and trust among people was replaced by fear.<br>For reasons unknown, the skin of all mortals began to harden, and in their panic, they turned against one another.<br>You must gather those who still hold the will to return to their former selves, lead an expedition, and carve a new destiny.<br>Every choice you make will shape your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover dangers and rewards as you delve into mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/0f49d353c5ce93425b4550303aaf8124.poster.avif?t=1759597549\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/0f49d353c5ce93425b4550303aaf8124.webm?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/0f49d353c5ce93425b4550303aaf8124.mp4?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in unpredictable, dice-based tactical battles that demand strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a349bdc59284ff2054eec1bc0f3429ca.poster.avif?t=1759597549\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a349bdc59284ff2054eec1bc0f3429ca.webm?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/a349bdc59284ff2054eec1bc0f3429ca.mp4?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Expedition Management</strong> \u2013 Recruit and grow your units to form a unique, customized expedition team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.poster.avif?t=1759597549\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.webm?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/4269164bf61aa2e9e8ba84b9e0043f04.mp4?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Secure your survival through lumbering, mining, and item crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/f580a296a495ca74f2aaac50235ab2d9.avif?t=1759597549\" width=500 height=281 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Development Intent &amp; Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brothers have deeply inspired me with their strategic depth and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 1 person team, I\u2019ve spent several years creating this game as a tribute to these exceptional title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will continue developing Ashen Dungeon to deliver its own unique and compelling experience, and I sincerely welcome your ongoing feedback and support.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612160?t=1759597549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612160?t=1759597549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/4b53e6d7e785efd3a07e1fc9d3dc086aed148fb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759597549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/4b53e6d7e785efd3a07e1fc9d3dc086aed148fb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759597549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Skeleton objects are placed in the scene, and damage occurs due to combat between characters and monsters. Although blood is not shown, petrified mortals can still meet their death."},"demos":[{"appid":4030080,"description":""}],"detailed_des