3f04.mp4?t=1759597549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Secure your survival through lumbering, mining, and item crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/extras/f580a296a495ca74f2aaac50235ab2d9.avif?t=1759597549\" width=500 height=281 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Development Intent &amp; Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Brothers have deeply inspired me with their strategic depth and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 1 person team, I\u2019ve spent several years creating this game as a tribute to these exceptional title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I will continue developing Ashen Dungeon to deliver its own unique and compelling experience, and I sincerely welcome your ongoing feedback and support.</p>","developers":["RasEn Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612160/bb6c2b7ac2c4842255a5b5fea4e2f7fe4b9a7ab9/header.jpg?t=1759597549","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612160/826597965/53bde0ea58f6970d37c3a464b6091219b438b298/1759519806/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759520254","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612160/826597965/53bde0ea58f6970d37c3a464b6091219b438b298/1759519806/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759520254","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612160/826597965/53bde0ea58f6970d37c3a464b6091219b438b298/1759519806/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759520254","id":257148912,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steam